# Multicomponent DFT: LDA electrons with the epc17-2 electron-proton
# correlation functional, one quantum proton, unrestricted cation.
System H2O.xyz
Basis cc-pVDZ
ProtonBasis PB4-D
QuantumProtons 2
Method lda_x-lda_c_vwn
EPCFunctional lda_c_epc17_2
Charge 1
Multiplicity 2
DFTGrid 75 -302
SaveChk neo_dft_epc_u.chk
